			"color":"#432",
			"widgets_values":[
				"## 📦 WAN Models to Download\n\n---\n\n### 🔴 Main WAN Model  \n`Phantom-Wan-14B_fp16`  \n🔗[Download Link](https://huggingface.co/Kijai/WanVideo_comfy/resolve/main/Phantom-Wan-14B_fp16.safetensors?download=true)\n\nOR\n\n`Phantom-Wan-14B_fp8`  \n🔗[DownloadLink](https://huggingface.co/Kijai/WanVideo_comfy/resolve/main/Phantom-Wan-14B_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensors?download=true)\n\n🗂️ Place in: `ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models`\n\n---\n\n### 🔴 FusionX Phantom LoRa \n`Wan2.1_Phantom_FusionX_LoRA'  \n🔗 [Download Link](https://civitai.com/models/1678575?modelVersionId=1900357)\n\n🗂️ Place in: `ComfyUI/models/loras`\n\n---\n\n### 🟣 WAN VAE  \n`Wan2_1_VAE_bf16`  \n🔗 [Download Link](https://huggingface.co/Kijai/WanVideo_comfy/resolve/main/Wan2_1_VAE_bf16.safetensors?download=true)\n\nOR\n\n`wan2_1_vae_fp8`  \n🔗 [Download Link](https://huggingface.co/calcuis/wan-gguf/resolve/2a7520ea1e79d3f1f3f454a938613235633e1cba/wan2_1_vae_fp8.safetensors)\n\n🗂️ Place in: `ComfyUI/models/vae`\n\n\n---\n### 🟣 WAN Text Encoder\n`umt5-xxl-enc-bf16.safetensors`  \n🔗 [Download Link](https://huggingface.co/Kijai/WanVideo_comfy/resolve/main/umt5-xxl-enc-bf16.safetensors)\n\nOR\n\n`umt5-xxl-enc-fp8.safetensors`  \n🔗 [Download Link](https://huggingface.co/Kijai/WanVideo_comfy/resolve/main/umt5-xxl-enc-fp8_e4m3fn.safetensors)\n\n\n🗂️ Place in: `ComfyUI/models/text_encoders`\n\n---\n### ⚠️ Torch Compile Warning  \nIf your setup doesn’t support torch compile, set attention mode to `sdpa` in the model loader and bypas the Torch Compile settings and adjust the base_precision to just fp16\n\n---\n\n### ⚠️ Block Swapping\nBlock swapping helps if you have lower VRAM and/or get OOM. You can bypass it first and then update the blocks to swap to a higher number till you don't get OOM (up to 40) It will run slower so don't use if you have enough VRAM.\n\n---\n\n### ⚠️ Errors\nIf you get an error about 'fp16_accumulation'\nthis just means you need to update your base_precision in the model loader to fp16 from fp16_fast.\n\n---\n"
			],
